This photo shows what is left after a meal, not the full meal. The leftovers are a small chicken bone with a little meat and skin, some crumbs and small bits of green pepper on the large plate, and a sauce smear on the small plate. There is also an empty bar wrapper and a glass with a little water, which I counted as no food.

The remaining food is very small, so I estimated about 10 g and about 20 kcal.

